     "gloss_en": "Rav Mari son of Rav Kahana: is 'like the gazelle and like the hart', written of them, a small thing? as one does not redeem with gazelle and hart, so one does not redeem with disqualified consecrated animals (resolving the iba'ya, which asked whether ein issur chal al issur applies or it is a mere release of the prohibition)"
